g up  on lawn crime daily we take a closer  look at the moments after the marjory  stoneman douglas high school shooting  where the gunman visited just minutes  after the massacre and who he spoke with  before his arrest  [Music]  welcome back as the parkland school  shooter penalty phase continues witness  testimony causes emotional reactions  from parents of students who were killed  i observed a  child dead on the ground  on the left and there was like a smoke  and dust in the air  and i observed other officers a little  bit further ahead  i checked one room on the left-hand side  and then i went up to uh the front of  the officers that were there they were  clearing  the kids out of the rooms  and myself and another  officer went towards the front to kind  of  keep them covered as they were pulling  kids out i am over jamie gutenberg okay  and uh what happened you checked your  any vital signs yes i checked your vital  signs for breath and for pulse i found  none um and  uh i checked several times  and then  we held there for a moment and uh  officer schmidt and i heard a voice we  thought coming from the hallway okay and  what did you guys do  we cracked the door uh confirmed that  somebody in the hallway was asking for  help and we decided we were going to  move into the hallway to go get them we  moved into the hallway and walked  towards the voice which turned out to be  anthony borges  made contact with him  i was still looking down the hallway  covering in case we encountered a  subject  and the officers  dragged him back to get him into the  hallway to provide medical care  jurors were also shown surveillance  video of cruz just minutes after the  massacre when he visited mcdonald's and  later bought an icee from a subway  restaurant  i mean i saw him sit down so i just was  telling him you know like this is so  chaotic you know this is crazy all these  helicopters and swat cars coming like  what do you think this could be and  i don't remember him saying